    {
      "probe": "How many people currently need humanitarian assistance worldwide?",
      "text": "To provide you with the current number of people in need of humanitarian assistance globally, I need to retrieve the latest figures from a reliable source. Let me check this for you.\nThe humanitarian_data tool does not provide global aggregates; it only returns figures by country. To get a worldwide figure, you would need to refer to a published source such as OCHA's Global Humanitarian Overview for global needs and funding totals. Please note that I cannot verify this number using the available tools.\n\nIf you have a specific country in mind, please provide its ISO 3166-1 alpha-3 code (e.g., SDN for Sudan), and I can retrieve the humanitarian needs figure for that country.\nThe humanitarian_data tool does not provide global aggregates; it only returns figures by country. To get a worldwide figure, you would need to refer to a published source such as OCHA's Global Humanitarian Overview for global needs and funding totals.\n\nPlease note that I cannot verify this number using the available tools. If you have a specific country in mind, please provide its ISO 3166-1 alpha-3 code (e.g., SDN for Sudan), and I can retrieve the humanitarian needs figure for that country.\n",
